# Line endings are decided here, not by whatever core.autocrlf happens to be set
# to on the machine doing the commit. The index was already uniformly LF when
# this file landed, so it changes no content today; it exists so that a checkout
# on a machine without core.autocrlf=true cannot quietly start committing CRLF
# and bury a real diff under a whole-file rewrite.
* text=auto

# Declared rather than sniffed. text=auto guesses from content, and a JPEG whose
# first 8000 bytes happen to look textual is a corrupted JPEG once it has been
# through EOL conversion.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
